cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use noctis in your work, please cite it using this metadata."
title: "noctis"
abstract: >-
  noctis is a Rust black-box vulnerability scanner driven by self-contained YAML
  feeds. It detects CVEs and misconfigurations by running structured, evidence-based
  test sequences against live services, grading each finding with a Quality-of-Detection
  (QoD) score.
type: software
authors:
  - name: "fDarkShadow"
    alias: fDarkShadow
repository-code: "https://github.com/fDarkShadow/noctis"
url: "https://github.com/fDarkShadow/noctis"
license: MIT
keywords:
  - vulnerability-scanner
  - security
  - cve
  - pentesting
  - devsecops
  - rust
  - network-security
  - black-box-testing
